    "body": "It feels weird to me to talk about using the forgiving-base64 encode algorithm to encode this data since the browser isn't what is doing the encoding, it is the external script. I think it would make more sense to say that this is \"the manufacturer data byte sequence, base64 encoded\" and then specify in the algorithm steps which process this command that we use \"forgiving-base64 decode\" to interpret this externally-provided value.",
